 ⚡ Quick Start


## 2. Create virtual environment

### Windows

```powershell
python -m venv .venv
```

Activate:

```powershell
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```

If your environment uses `bin`:

```powershell
.\.venv\bin\activate


## 3. Install dependencies

```powershell
python -m pip install -r backend\requirements.txt
```

---

## 4. Configure Hindsight

Copy:

```text
.env.example
```

to:

```text
.env
```

Add your Hindsight configuration.

```env
HINDSIGHT_API_KEY=your_api_key
HINDSIGHT_BANK_ID=your_bank_id
```

> ⚠️ **Never commit `.env` or real API keys to GitHub.**

---

## 5. Start the application

```powershell
python -m uvicorn backend.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

Open:

**http://127.0.0.1:8000/**

Health check:

**http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health**

---

# 🔌 API

| Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|
| `GET /api/health` | Health and Hindsight status |
| `GET /api/deals` | Retrieve deals |
| `POST /api/deals` | Create a new deal |
| `GET /api/stats/{deal_id}` | Deal statistics |
| `GET /api/learning/{deal_id}` | Learning timeline |
| `GET /api/playbook/{deal_id}` | Winning / failed patterns |
| `POST /api/recommend` | Generate next best action |
| `POST /api/autopsy` | Record deal outcome |
| `POST /api/learning-experiment` | Test memory-driven decision change |
| `POST /api/seed` | Seed demonstration data |
| `GET /api/memory-proof/{deal_id}` | Verify memory integration |

---

# 🧪 Validation

The repository contains automated validation scripts.

Run:

```powershell
python tests/full_acceptance_test.py
```

Visual validation:

```powershell
python tests/visual_check.py
```

Complete validation:

```powershell
python tests/run_full_validation.py
```

The validation suite covers the major application flow, API availability, learning workflow and UI behavior.

